nt-cut/avatars-photo/avatar_16.webp`)},{id:`sphere-cut`,name:`Sphere Cut`,description:`Ride a sentence across fisheye spheres on die-cut stickers.`,thumbnailUrl:F1(`hybrid-sphere-cut/packs/spheres/1.jpg`)},{id:`word-reel`,name:`Word Reel`,description:`Flip a word through paper pages with a highlighter pin.`,thumbnailUrl:F1(`hybrid-word-reel/papers/white/1.jpg`)},{id:`note-reel`,name:`Note Reel`,description:`Type a word in pencil, then strobe it across torn desk notes.`,thumbnailUrl:F1(`hybrid-note-reel/sets/night/1.jpg`)},{id:`logo-cut`,name:`Logo Cut`,description:`Stamp a logo through a strobe of photos, glass and studio solids.`,thumbnailUrl:F1(`hybrid-logo-cut/night/1.jpg`)},{id:`face-cut`,name:`Face Cut`,description:`Align photos of one person by their eyes and turn them into a rapid match-cut reel.`,slug:`face-cut`,thumbnailUrl:T1(`selfie.png`)},{id:`product-cut`,name:`Product Cut`,description:`Cut out one product and pin it over a rapid sequence of backgrounds.`,slug:`product-cut`,thumbnailUrl:T1(`through-object-out.png`)},{id:`object-match`,name:`Object Match`,description:`Pin the same object across an ordered set of photos.`,thumbnailUrl:T1(`through-object-out.png`),hidden:!0},{id:`tracelab-motion`,name:`Tracelab Motion`,description:`Track subjects and draw animated overlays over a video.`,thumbnailUrl:F1(`hybrid-tracelab-motion/assets/editable-preview.png`)},{id:`text-warp`,name:`Round Typography`,description:`Wrap running typography around the subject in a video.`,slug:`round-typography`,thumbnailUrl:F1(`text-warp/thumbnail.webp`)},{id:`echo-print`,name:`Echo Print`,description:`Create a spiral duplication trail that collapses into one silhouette.`,thumbnailUrl:F1(`echo-print/thumbnail.jpg`)},{id:`notebook`,name:`Notebook`,description:`Place handwritten words on a real notebook and push the camera into every cut.`,thumbnailUrl:F1(`hybrid-notebook/assets/desks/9x16/1.jpg`)},{id:`kinetic-type`,name:`Kinetic Type`,description:`B/w kinetic typography cards typed out of one script line, rebuilt 1:1 from the reference edit.`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/kinetic-type/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`warp-loop`,name:`Warp Loop`,description:`Riso-poster word that inflates, stretches, drapes and collapses in a seamless 5s loop, 1:1 to the DAMN reference.`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/warp-loop/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`wave-stack`,name:`Wave Stack`,description:`Photocopied poster of stacked heavy caps squeezed by a traveling wave on a seamless 2s loop, 1:1 to the CLOSED reference.`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/wave-stack/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`balloon-type`,name:`Balloon Type`,description:`The word swells letter by letter into fat balloon blobs, breathes, then blows up until it fills the frame — 1:1 to the MORPH reference loop.`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/balloon-type/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`hope-vortex`,name:`Hope Vortex`,description:`Two words curl into a log-polar spiral medallion and whip around with elastic spin kicks — 1:1 to the HOPE/NOPE riso reference.`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/hope-vortex/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`scrawl-type`,name:`Scrawl Type`,description:`Hand-scrawled chalk lyric cards boiling at 24 Hz — 1:1 to the reference lyric video.`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/scrawl-type/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`funnel-type`,name:`Funnel Type`,description:`A word spirals down a 3D text funnel on a seamless screw loop, 1:1 to the FOCUS reference.`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/funnel-type/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`misprint-type`,name:`Misprint Type`,description:`A giant headline breathes in a left-to-right weight wave over a neon misprint row that re-inks itself every frame, 1:1 to the ZERO ENERGY reference.`,slug:`misprint-type`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/misprint-type/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`space-type`,name:`Space Type`,description:`The camera swings inside a room wallpapered with your word on a seamless loop, 1:1 to the SPACE reference.`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/space-type/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`toon-shake`,name:`Toon Shake`,description:`The video freezes into a bleached cartoon still and ransom-note paper words uncrumple onto it, boiling on twos.`,slug:`toon-shake`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/toon-shake/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`low-poly-y2k`,name:`Low Poly Y2K`,description:`PS1-era retro 3D: pixel raster, low poly triangle mosaic, Bayer-dithered posterization and soft N64 textures.`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/low-poly-y2k/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`lidar-chrome`,name:`LiDAR Chrome`,description:`Liquid-metal duotone remap swept by a laser scan seam, with point-cloud dissolve, voxel glitches, bloom and film grain.`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/lidar-chrome/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`stutter-cut`,name:`Stutter Cut`,description:`Playback jams on a micro-loop of the last few frames, machine-guns it, then continues from the loop end — the clean temporal stutter edit.`,slug:`stutter-cut`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/stutter-cut/thumbnail.webp`},{id:`object-tracking`,name:`Object Tracking`,description:`Scan a clip once on this device, then follow any detected object with a HUD box, marker and path.`,slug:`object-tracking`,thumbnailUrl:`https://static.higgsfield.ai/public/viral-hub/presets/object-tracking/thumbnail.svg`},{id:`search-cut`,name:`Search Cut`,description:`Flash through procedural search pages while every word stays pinned in place.`,thumbnailUrl:F1(`hybrid-search-cut/assets/thumbnail.svg`)}],R1=L1.filter(D1),z1=new Set([`kinetic-type`,`warp-loop`,`wave-stack`,`balloon-type`,`hope-vortex`,`scrawl-type`,`funne